    <entry_item>
      <dico>Boberg</dico>
      <unicode>ᠠᠵᠠᠷᠺᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>eǰergekü</uighur>
      <definition>v.i. To act arbitrarily or despotically, to usurp, to monopolize, to dominate, to expand by force, to act on one's own responsibility.</definition>
